# Direct test/lint dependencies. Not installed in production, so these float
# rather than tracking the production freeze.
#
# The lock is test-requirements.txt, which is generated and must not be edited
# by hand:
#
#   uv pip compile test-requirements.in -o test-requirements.txt \
#       --python-version 3.9 --generate-hashes -c requirements.txt
#
# The `-c requirements.txt` keeps shared packages (Jinja2, MarkupSafe, ...) at
# the versions the runtime lock already chose.
flake8
Flask
pexpect
pylint
pytest
pytest-cov
